# TEMPLATE CONFIGURATION — MANDATORY

> **⚠️ CRITICAL: Output MUST match the canonical example format EXACTLY.**
> **Canonical full anchor:** `examples/01_oracle_changepo/` (main doc + all 7 supporting docs)
> **Literal templates:** `templates/documentation-template-guide.md`
> **Declarative config:** `templates/documentation-style.yaml`
> **Decoupling:** Rules reference sections by NAME; this file + `templates/` own the structure.

---

## ⚠️ MANDATORY ENFORCEMENT

```
╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║  BEFORE CREATING ANY OUTPUT FILE:                                     ║
║   1. READ templates/documentation-style.yaml                         ║
║   2. READ templates/documentation-template-guide.md                  ║
║   3. READ examples/01_oracle_changepo/ (main + supporting-docs)      ║
║                                                                       ║
║  YOUR OUTPUT STRUCTURE MUST MATCH THE EXAMPLE EXACTLY —              ║
║  same headers, section order, table columns, reference blockquotes,  ║
║  and certification box. Only the EXTRACTED VALUES change.            ║
╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
```

Consistency is the product. Two different BizTalk apps must yield two structurally identical documents.

