## DIAGRAM SPECIFICATIONS

| Diagram | Type | Location | Rules |
|---------|------|----------|-------|
| System context | `flowchart LR` | Section 2 | `curve: linear` init; `<br/>` labels; style by role |
| Orchestration flow | `flowchart TD` | Section 3 (one per `.odx`) | branches for Decision/Parallel; dashed `-.->` for catch/back-edges |

MANDATORY atop every flowchart: `%%{ init: { 'flowchart': { 'curve': 'linear' } } }%%`. Never use `\n` in labels. Mermaid standards: `@02_Guidance.mdc §6`.

