## SUPPORTING DOCUMENT FORMATS

Each supporting doc opens with `# {Title} — {app_name}` + a `> Phase {n}.` scope line. Exact per-doc structures (tables, trees, code blocks, certification box) are in `templates/documentation-template-guide.md → SUPPORTING DOCUMENT — EXACT TEMPLATES`. Summary:

| Doc | Must contain |
|-----|--------------|
| artifact-inventory.md | files table, artifact-type counts, assembly-ref graph (tree), referenced-but-absent table |
| orchestration-flows.md | per-orch: ports/messages/variables tables, shape table, **verbatim csharp blocks (never truncated)**, helper call-sites, Mermaid flow |
| schema-structures.md | per-schema property table, structure tree, fields-in-use (when body absent) |
| map-mappings.md | `.btm`↔`.xsl` divergence note, EVERY link table, body template, header/control |
| pipeline-helper-reference.md | pipelines, ports table, helpers (🔴 GAP when absent), framework calls |
| replication-gap-report.md | BizTalk→MuleSoft table, gap register, Tree-of-Thought for ambiguous rebuilds |
| verification-checklist.md | file-by-file reconciliation, count summary, quality checklist, **certification box** |

