## TEMPLATE-DRIVEN RULES

- **Match the example exactly** — same structure for every app; only extracted values differ.
- **Section inclusion** governed by `documentation-style.yaml`; absent artifact → "Not applicable", never omitted.
- **Markers**: `[ENCRYPTED]` (secrets), `[ENV]` (environment values), `[NOT IN EXPORT]` (missing), `🔴 GAP`, `⚠️ ASSUMPTION`.
- **Citations**: every row/claim cites its source file (+ OID/Link ID where available).
- **Verbosity**: benchmark conciseness against `examples/01_oracle_changepo/` — complete, not padded.

